{"seq":2,"slug":"audit-logging","title":"审计日志","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/compliance-frameworks/audit-logging","wordCount":1506,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"审计日志\">审计日志</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>审计日志（Audit Logging）是系统对安全相关事件的完整、不可篡改、可追溯的记录机制。审计日志回答&quot;谁在什么时间对什么资源做了什么操作，结果是什么&quot;这一核心安全问题。与应用日志（记录程序运行状态）和访问日志（记录网络请求）不同，审计日志的关注点是<strong>操作的合规性和安全性</strong>——它是安全事件调查、合规审计和内部威胁检测的核心数据源。</p>\n<p>审计日志的设计必须满足三个基本属性：<strong>完整性</strong>（所有安全相关事件都被记录）、<strong>不可篡改性</strong>（日志一旦写入不能被修改或删除）和<strong>可用性</strong>（日志可以被高效检索和分析）。在云原生环境中，审计日志通常从多个层面采集——云平台层（AWS CloudTrail）、Kubernetes 集群层（API Server Audit Log）、应用层（业务操作日志）和数据库层（数据访问日志）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 审计日志层级&#10;        A[云平台审计] --&gt; E[集中存储]&#10;        B[Kubernetes审计] --&gt; E&#10;        C[应用审计] --&gt; E&#10;        D[数据库审计] --&gt; E&#10;    end&#10;    E --&gt; F[安全分析/SIEM]&#10;    E --&gt; G[合规报告]&#10;    E --&gt; H[事件调查]\">graph TB\n    subgraph 审计日志层级\n        A[云平台审计] --&gt; E[集中存储]\n        B[Kubernetes审计] --&gt; E\n        C[应用审计] --&gt; E\n        D[数据库审计] --&gt; E\n    end\n    E --&gt; F[安全分析/SIEM]\n    E --&gt; G[合规报告]\n    E --&gt; H[事件调查]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>审计层级</th>\n<th>数据源</th>\n<th>记录内容</th>\n<th>工具/服务</th>\n<th>保留要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>云平台</td>\n<td>API 调用</td>\n<td>资源创建/修改/删除</td>\n<td>AWS CloudTrail/GCP Audit</td>\n<td>1-7年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kubernetes</td>\n<td>API Server</td>\n<td>Pod/Deployment/Secret操作</td>\n<td>K8s Audit Policy</td>\n<td>90天-1年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用层</td>\n<td>业务操作</td>\n<td>用户登录/权限变更/数据操作</td>\n<td>自定义审计SDK</td>\n<td>1-7年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库</td>\n<td>SQL 语句</td>\n<td>数据查询/修改/删除</td>\n<td>pgAudit/MySQL Enterprise</td>\n<td>1-7年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络层</td>\n<td>流量日志</td>\n<td>网络连接/DNS查询</td>\n<td>VPC Flow Logs</td>\n<td>90天</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"审计日志结构设计\">审计日志结构设计</h2><p>一条完整的审计日志事件应包含足够的上下文信息来还原操作的完整场景。标准化的日志结构确保不同来源的审计事件可以统一存储、查询和分析。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface AuditEvent {&#10;  eventId: string;&#10;  timestamp: string;&#10;  actor: {&#10;    type: &#39;user&#39; | &#39;service&#39; | &#39;system&#39;;&#10;    id: string;&#10;    name: string;&#10;    ip: string;&#10;    userAgent?: string;&#10;    sessionId?: string;&#10;  };&#10;  action: {&#10;    type: &#39;create&#39; | &#39;read&#39; | &#39;update&#39; | &#39;delete&#39; | &#39;login&#39; | &#39;logout&#39; | &#39;export&#39; | &#39;admin&#39;;&#10;    name: string;&#10;    category: string;&#10;  };&#10;  resource: {&#10;    type: string;&#10;    id: string;&#10;    name?: string;&#10;    attributes?: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;  };&#10;  outcome: {&#10;    status: &#39;success&#39; | &#39;failure&#39; | &#39;denied&#39;;&#10;    reason?: string;&#10;    statusCode?: number;&#10;  };&#10;  context: {&#10;    requestId: string;&#10;    traceId?: string;&#10;    environment: string;&#10;    region: string;&#10;    source: string;&#10;  };&#10;  changes?: {&#10;    field: string;&#10;    oldValue: unknown;&#10;    newValue: unknown;&#10;  }[];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AuditEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  eventId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  actor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'user'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'service'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'system'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    ip</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    userAgent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    sessionId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'create'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'read'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'update'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'delete'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'login'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'logout'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'export'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'admin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    category</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  resource</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    attributes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  outcome</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'success'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'failure'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'denied'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    statusCode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    requestId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    traceId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    region</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  changes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    field</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    oldValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    newValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>设计原则</strong>：</p>\n<p><strong>避免记录敏感数据</strong>：审计日志中不应包含密码、密钥、完整信用卡号等敏感信息。对于必须记录的个人身份信息（PII），使用脱敏处理（如邮箱显示为 <code>u***@example.com</code>）。</p>\n<p><strong>变更差异记录</strong>：对于更新操作，记录变更前后的值差异（<code>changes</code> 字段）而非仅记录&quot;已修改&quot;。这对安全调查至关重要——&quot;管理员将用户 A 的角色从 Viewer 改为 Admin&quot;比&quot;管理员修改了用户 A 的信息&quot;提供了更多安全上下文。</p>\n<p><strong>幂等性</strong>：审计事件应该有唯一的 <code>eventId</code>，确保在重试或重复投递场景下不会产生重复记录。消费端可以基于 <code>eventId</code> 去重。</p>\n<h2 id=\"kubernetes-审计策略\">Kubernetes 审计策略</h2><p>Kubernetes API Server 的审计功能记录所有对集群 API 的操作请求。审计策略（Audit Policy）定义了哪些事件需要记录以及记录的详细程度。</p>\n<p><strong>四个审计级别</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>None</code>：不记录任何信息</li>\n<li><code>Metadata</code>：只记录请求元数据（用户、时间、资源、动作），不记录请求/响应体</li>\n<li><code>Request</code>：记录元数据 + 请求体</li>\n<li><code>RequestResponse</code>：记录元数据 + 请求体 + 响应体（最详细但数据量最大）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: audit.k8s.io/v1&#10;kind: Policy&#10;rules:&#10;  - level: RequestResponse&#10;    resources:&#10;      - group: &#39;&#39;&#10;        resources: [&#39;secrets&#39;, &#39;configmaps&#39;]&#10;    verbs: [&#39;create&#39;, &#39;update&#39;, &#39;patch&#39;, &#39;delete&#39;]&#10;&#10;  - level: Metadata&#10;    resources:&#10;      - group: &#39;rbac.authorization.k8s.io&#39;&#10;        resources: [&#39;roles&#39;, &#39;rolebindings&#39;, &#39;clusterroles&#39;, &#39;clusterrolebindings&#39;]&#10;&#10;  - level: Request&#10;    resources:&#10;      - group: &#39;&#39;&#10;        resources: [&#39;pods&#39;, &#39;services&#39;, &#39;deployments&#39;]&#10;    verbs: [&#39;create&#39;, &#39;update&#39;, &#39;delete&#39;]&#10;&#10;  - level: None&#10;    resources:&#10;      - group: &#39;&#39;&#10;        resources: [&#39;endpoints&#39;, &#39;events&#39;]&#10;&#10;  - level: Metadata&#10;    users: [&#39;system:serviceaccount:kube-system:*&#39;]&#10;    verbs: [&#39;get&#39;, &#39;list&#39;, &#39;watch&#39;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">audit.k8s.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Policy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">level</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">RequestResponse</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'secrets'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'configmaps'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    verbs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'create'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'update'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'patch'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'delete'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">level</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Metadata</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rbac.authorization.k8s.io'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'roles'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rolebindings'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'clusterroles'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'clusterrolebindings'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">level</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Request</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pods'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'services'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'deployments'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    verbs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'create'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'update'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'delete'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">level</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'endpoints'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'events'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">level</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Metadata</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    users</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'system:serviceaccount:kube-system:*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    verbs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'get'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'list'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'watch'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>高风险操作监控</strong>：Secret 的创建和修改、RBAC 角色变更、Admission Webhook 配置修改、节点状态变更都应设置为 <code>RequestResponse</code> 级别。这些操作一旦被恶意利用，可能导致集群被完全接管。</p>\n<h2 id=\"审计日志存储与安全\">审计日志存储与安全</h2><p><strong>不可篡改存储</strong>是审计日志安全的基石。攻击者在入侵系统后通常会尝试删除或修改审计日志以掩盖痕迹。因此，审计日志必须存储在攻击者无法触及的独立系统中。</p>\n<p><strong>WORM 存储</strong>（Write Once Read Many）：AWS S3 Object Lock 和 Azure Blob Storage Immutability Policy 提供了对象级别的 WORM 保护。一旦写入，在指定保留期内无法修改或删除，即使拥有 Root 权限也无法绕过。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>存储方案</th>\n<th>不可篡改性</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>查询能力</th>\n<th>合规认证</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>S3 + Object Lock</td>\n<td>法律级不可变</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>需配合Athena</td>\n<td>SOC2/ISO27001</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CloudWatch Logs</td>\n<td>保留期保护</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>原生查询</td>\n<td>AWS合规</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Elasticsearch + 只读索引</td>\n<td>应用级不可变</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>强查询</td>\n<td>需额外认证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Splunk</td>\n<td>应用级不可变</td>\n<td>很高</td>\n<td>极强</td>\n<td>多标准认证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>分离存储原则</strong>：审计日志应存储在与业务系统隔离的 AWS 账户或 GCP 项目中。业务系统的管理员不应有权限访问审计日志存储——形成权限分离（Separation of Duties）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"审计分析与安全检测\">审计分析与安全检测</h2><p>审计日志的价值不仅在于事后调查，更在于实时检测可疑行为。</p>\n<p><strong>基于规则的检测</strong>：定义已知攻击模式的检测规则。例如：短时间内同一 IP 的多次登录失败→暴力破解攻击；非工作时间的 Secret 访问→潜在内部威胁；服务账户执行了超出正常范围的操作→服务账户泄露。</p>\n<p><strong>异常检测</strong>：基于历史基线建立正常行为模型，偏离基线的行为触发告警。例如：某用户通常在工作日 9-18 点登录，突然在凌晨 3 点从异常 IP 登录→账户可能被盗。UEBA（User and Entity Behavior Analytics）工具专门用于此类分析。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 审计分析流程&#10;        A[审计事件流] --&gt; B[实时规则引擎]&#10;        A --&gt; C[异常检测模型]&#10;        B --&gt; D[安全告警]&#10;        C --&gt; D&#10;        D --&gt; E[SIEM平台]&#10;        E --&gt; F[安全团队响应]&#10;        A --&gt; G[长期存储]&#10;        G --&gt; H[合规报告]&#10;        G --&gt; I[事件调查]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 审计分析流程\n        A[审计事件流] --&gt; B[实时规则引擎]\n        A --&gt; C[异常检测模型]\n        B --&gt; D[安全告警]\n        C --&gt; D\n        D --&gt; E[SIEM平台]\n        E --&gt; F[安全团队响应]\n        A --&gt; G[长期存储]\n        G --&gt; H[合规报告]\n        G --&gt; I[事件调查]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>审计日志记录&quot;谁在何时对什么资源做了什么操作&quot;，是安全调查、合规审计和威胁检测的核心数据源</li>\n<li>审计事件结构应包含 actor、action、resource、outcome 和 context 五大维度，变更操作需记录前后值差异</li>\n<li>Kubernetes 审计策略按 None/Metadata/Request/RequestResponse 四级控制记录详细程度，高风险操作（Secret/RBAC）应使用最高级别</li>\n<li>WORM 存储（S3 Object Lock）保证审计日志的法律级不可篡改性，分离存储原则确保管理员无法删除审计记录</li>\n<li>实时规则检测已知攻击模式，UEBA 异常检测发现未知威胁，两者结合构建完整的安全检测能力</li>\n<li>审计日志中不应包含明文密码、密钥等敏感数据，PII 信息需要脱敏处理</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"审计日志","id":"审计日志"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"审计日志结构设计","id":"审计日志结构设计"},{"level":2,"text":"Kubernetes 审计策略","id":"kubernetes-审计策略"},{"level":2,"text":"审计日志存储与安全","id":"审计日志存储与安全"},{"level":2,"text":"审计分析与安全检测","id":"审计分析与安全检测"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"合规框架概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/compliance-frameworks/compliance-overview"},"next":{"title":"合规即代码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/compliance-frameworks/compliance-as-code"}}